message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Student injury triage assistant"
abstract: >-
  A neurosymbolic assistant built with the cognition library. It helps K-12 school staff follow a
  student injury policy in real time: it determines the triage tier, gives the required next step, and
  tracks the policy's checklist and deadlines.
